    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43554" root="&#xA;                        مرق&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْقُ الإِهَابِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>The burying of the skin,</i> or <i>hide,
in the earth, so that its hair may be removed, and
it may become ready for tanning.</i> (K, * TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افق</span>.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَقَ</span>.

